s/d3b46b2163c5721a9815532aacb4f5d9.poster.avif?t=1766487597\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851780/extras/d3b46b2163c5721a9815532aacb4f5d9.webm?t=1766487597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851780/extras/d3b46b2163c5721a9815532aacb4f5d9.mp4?t=1766487597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers will complain if your shop is not clean enough!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851780/extras/0f1def2e9ebafcca4e40bd4a7bd3e4ec.avif?t=1766487597\" width=728 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851780/extras/e9b0cdcf96154423df80c880aeb3ac21.poster.avif?t=1766487597\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851780/extras/e9b0cdcf96154423df80c880aeb3ac21.webm?t=1766487597\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3851780/extras/e9b0cdcf96154423df80c880aeb3ac21.mp4?t=1766487597\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cash doesn’t come easy, better have a plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your Supermarket Empire</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small with a humble grocery store and grow it into a thriving retail empire. Design and customize your store layout, optimize product placement, and create the perfect shopping environment for your customers. The more you succeed, the more you can expand, buying new departments, special offers, and promotions to attract even more shoppers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Management</strong><br>The key to success lies in balancing supply and demand. Keep an eye on inventory levels, track sales trends, and make sure your store never runs out of popular items. Hire and manage staff, improve efficiency, and make strategic decisions to maximize your profits. Watch out for fluctuating prices, and don’t forget to compete with rival supermarkets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customer Satisfaction Is Everything</strong><br>Your customers have specific needs and preferences. Some like the finest gourmet products, while others want quick, low-cost items. Satisfy their needs by offering a diverse range of products, running special promotions, and providing excellent customer service. Build your reputation as the go-to store in town and keep your customers coming back for more!</p>",
